---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionImageText from '../../components/SectionImageText.astro';
import CategoryCard from '../../components/CategoryCard.astro';

const title = "VTC vs Taxi vs Uber in Nice: Which Transport to Choose? | ECOFUNDRIVE";
const description = "Complete comparison of VTC, Taxi and Uber in Nice and on the French Riviera. Prices, pros, cons, availability. Guide to choosing the best transport option.";
const keywords = [
  'VTC vs taxi Nice',
  'Uber Nice airport',
  'taxi or Uber Nice',
  'private driver vs taxi',
  'Nice airport transport options'
];
---

<BaseLayout 
  title={title}
  description={description}
  currentPage="en-vtc-vs-taxi-uber"
  canonical="/en/vtc-vs-taxi-uber-nice"
  lang="en"
  breadcrumbItems={[
    { name: "Home", url: "/en" },
    { name: "Guides", url: "/en/guides" },
    { name: "VTC vs Taxi vs Uber", url: "/en/vtc-vs-taxi-uber-nice" }
  ]}
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <div class="container py-lg">
      <h1 class="text-center mb-lg">{title}</h1>
      <p class="lead text-center mb-xl">{description}</p>
    </div>

    <section class="container py-lg fade-in-section">
      <h2>Introduction: Getting Around Nice in 2025</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you're arriving at <strong>Nice Côte d'Azur Airport</strong>, exploring the city, or heading to Monaco, Cannes, or Saint-Tropez, you have several transport options: <strong>VTC (professional private driver)</strong>, <strong>traditional taxi</strong>, and <strong>ride-sharing apps like Uber</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        But which one should you choose? The differences in pricing, service quality, and availability are significant. This comparison guide helps you make the right choice for your situation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="container py-xl fade-in-section">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-lg">Comparison Table: VTC vs Taxi vs Uber in Nice</h2>
      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="comparison-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Criteria</th>
              <th class="vtc-col">🚗 VTC (ECOFUNDRIVE)</th>
              <th>🚕 Taxi</th>
              <th>📱 Uber</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Price: Nice Airport → City Center</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">€30-40 (fixed)</td>
              <td>€30-45 (meter)</td>
              <td>€25-50 (variable)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Price known in advance</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Always</td>
              <td>❌ No (meter)</td>
              <td>⚠️ Estimate (surge pricing)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Advance booking</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Required, guaranteed</td>
              <td>⚠️ Possible but not guaranteed</td>
              <td>❌ Real-time only</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Airport availability</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Personal meet & greet</td>
              <td>✅ Taxi queue</td>
              <td>⚠️ Variable by time</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Welcome with name board</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Included</td>
              <td>❌ No</td>
              <td>❌ No</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Vehicle quality</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Premium (Tesla, Mercedes)</td>
              <td>⚠️ Variable</td>
              <td>⚠️ Variable</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Professional drivers</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Trained, multilingual</td>
              <td>✅ Professional</td>
              <td>⚠️ Part-time, variable</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Child seats available</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Free on request</td>
              <td>❌ Rarely</td>
              <td>❌ Rarely</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>24/7 availability</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Yes</td>
              <td>⚠️ Limited at night</td>
              <td>⚠️ Limited at night</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Long distance (Monaco, St-Tropez)</strong></td>
              <td class="vtc-col">✅ Specialty</td>
              <td>⚠️ Some refuse</td>
              <td>❌ Not available</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SectionImageText
      title="Advantages of VTC over Taxi"
      image="/assets/img/about/vehicule-premium.png"
      alt="Premium VTC interior"
      imageSide="right"
      ctaText="Book a VTC"
      ctaLink="/en/booking"
    >
      <h3 class="fade-in-section">1. Fixed Price Known in Advance</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        With a <strong>VTC like ECOFUNDRIVE</strong>, you know the exact fare before booking. No surprises from traffic jams, detours, or unexpected "extras." Taxis run on meters: the final price depends on traffic and route.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">2. Guaranteed Booking</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        When you book a VTC, your driver is <strong>guaranteed</strong>. They'll be there at the agreed time, whether it's 6 AM or midnight. With taxis, booking is "best effort" – if no taxi is available, you won't get one.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">3. Personal Airport Welcome</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        Your VTC driver waits at arrivals with a <strong>name board</strong>. They help with luggage and walk you to the vehicle. With taxis, you queue at the taxi stand.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">4. Premium Vehicles</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        VTCs like ECOFUNDRIVE use <strong>recent, premium vehicles</strong> (Tesla Model S, Mercedes E/S-Class). Taxi vehicle quality varies significantly.
      </p>
    </SectionImageText>

    <SectionImageText
      title="Advantages of VTC over Uber"
      image="/assets/img/services/service-business.png"
      alt="Professional VTC chauffeur"
      imageSide="left"
      ctaText="Book Now"
      ctaLink="/en/booking"
    >
      <h3 class="fade-in-section">1. Advance Booking</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        Uber doesn't allow guaranteed advance booking. You request in real-time and hope a driver is available. With a VTC, you book 24 hours, 1 week, or 1 month ahead – it's confirmed.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">2. No Surge Pricing</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        Uber applies <strong>dynamic pricing</strong>: during peak hours, events, or bad weather, prices can double or triple. VTC gives you a <strong>guaranteed fixed rate</strong> regardless of demand.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">3. Professional Drivers</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        VTC drivers are <strong>trained professionals</strong>, often with years of passenger transport experience. Uber drivers may be part-time workers doing this as a side job.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">4. Guaranteed Night Availability</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        Your flight arrives at 2 AM? With a VTC, your driver is there, guaranteed. With Uber, good luck finding a driver at that hour in Nice.
      </p>

      <h3 class="fade-in-section">5. Long Distance Available</h3>
      <p class="fade-in-section">
        Uber doesn't serve long-distance routes (Nice → Saint-Tropez, for example). VTC specializes in these transfers.
      </p>
    </SectionImageText>

    <section class="container py-xl fade-in-section">
      <h2 class="text-center mb-lg">When to Choose Each Option</h2>
      <div class="grid-3-cols">
        <div class="choice-card vtc-choice">
          <h3>🚗 Choose VTC if...</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>You're arriving at the airport and want a personal welcome</li>
            <li>You have an important meeting and can't be late</li>
            <li>You're traveling with children (child seats)</li>
            <li>You're going to Monaco, Saint-Tropez, or a long distance</li>
            <li>You're attending an event (Festival, MIPIM, Grand Prix)</li>
            <li>You want a fixed price with no surprises</li>
            <li>Your flight arrives early morning or late night</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="choice-card taxi-choice">
          <h3>🚕 Choose Taxi if...</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>You're already at a taxi stand (station, airport)</li>
            <li>You need immediate transport without booking</li>
            <li>Your trip is short (less than 10 km)</li>
            <li>Traffic is light and predictable</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="choice-card uber-choice">
          <h3>📱 Choose Uber if...</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>You're in the city and need quick transport</li>
            <li>It's off-peak hours (no surge pricing)</li>
            <li>You have no strict time constraints</li>
            <li>Your trip is urban and short distance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container py-lg bg-gold-light rounded-lg fade-in-section text-center">
      <h3 class="h4 mb-md">Ready to Book Your VTC?</h3>
      <p>Enjoy premium service, fixed guaranteed prices, and a professional driver.</p>
      <a href="/en/booking" class="btn btn-gold mt-md">Book Now</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .comparison-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .comparison-table th, .comparison-table td { padding: 0.75rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  .comparison-table th { background: #f5f5f5; font-weight: 600; }
  .vtc-col { background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1); font-weight: 600; }
  .table-responsive { overflow-x: auto; }
  .choice-card { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; }
  .choice-card h3 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .choice-card ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .choice-card li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .vtc-choice { background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1); border: 2px solid #d4af37; }
  .taxi-choice { background: #fff8e1; }
  .uber-choice { background: #e3f2fd; }
  .bg-gold-light { background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1); }
  .btn-gold { display: inline-block; background: #d4af37; color: #000; padding: 1rem 2rem; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn-gold:hover { background: #b8941f; }
</style>
